{"results": [{"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-088", "score": 0.109, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPS-088 | Study family SF-APPS-088: Offensive-identity resilience: connector absence vs usage-matched others\n- observed_research_question: Offensive-identity resilience: connector absence vs usage-matched others\n- auto_outcome_status: supported\n- observed_hypothesis: Connector absence displaces team offensive identity (D_A) more than usage-matched non-organizer absence.\n- observed_result: Unmatched conn vs role D_A 0.2020 vs 0.1021, t=5.97 p=2.87e-08. Usage-matched vs role: paired dD_A +0.1151, P(conn>ctrl)=81.2%, t=6.35 p=7.35e-09 n=96. Vs terminal: +0.0777 t=2.37 p=0.0261 n=25.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: D_positive (no failure: positive result)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:MECHANICAL_FLOOR\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER\n- observed_failure_evidence: Usage-matched connector vs role occupant identity break is large and significant (n=96). Licensed comparison excludes organizers.\n- observed_sample_and_power: n=96 matched pairs vs role; n=25 vs terminal; 908 player-seasons\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-PAP-028"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-PAP-016", "score": 0.097, "document": "# FAM:SF-PAP-016 | Study family SF-PAP-016: Portability feasibility gate\n- observed_research_question: Portability feasibility gate\n- auto_outcome_status: supported\n- observed_hypothesis: Enough movers with decoys exist and displacement signature is not collinear with play-type profile.\n- observed_result: Prereg: 296 movers, decoy frac 1.00, vacuity rho=0.048; final output: 294 movers, rho=0.007\n- auto_failure_mechanism: D_positive (no failure: positive result)\n- observed_failure_evidence: gate passed\n- observed_sample_and_power: 296/294 movers\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF19\n- observed_method: Mover signature cache; G1 >=25 movers, G2 >=80% with >=3 decoys, G3 |rho|<0.90.\n- observed_verdict: supported\n- observed_failure_type: D_positive\n- observed_notes: Mover count and vacuity rho changed between prereg record and final output.\n- auto_confidence: high (1.0)\n- auto_addresses_question: RQC:RQC-051\n- auto_uses_method: METH:correlation"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-PAP-029", "score": 0.096, "document": "# FAM:SF-PAP-029 | Study family SF-PAP-029: Destination outcome (net rating) checks for movers (archive)\n- observed_research_question: Destination outcome (net rating) checks for movers (archive)\n- auto_outcome_status: untestable\n- observed_hypothesis: Portability relates to destination net rating change.\n- observed_result: 'underpowered and null once corrected for landing-spot quality' (no numbers)\n- auto_failure_mechanism: A_unanswerable (question not answerable with the data or design)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:low_power_large_MDE\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER\n- observed_failure_evidence: stated underpowered\n- observed_sample_and_power: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-PAP-032\n- observed_method: Movers' destination on-court net rating incl. origin-to-destination change.\n- observed_verdict: null\n- observed_failure_type: A_unanswerable\n- observed_notes: Dropped from Paper 1.\n- auto_confidence: high (1.0)"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPM-022", "score": 0.094, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPM-022 | Study family SF-APPM-022: Superstar suppression profiles (incl. Q5c sequential triggering)\n- observed_research_question: Superstar suppression profiles (incl. Q5c sequential triggering)\n- auto_outcome_status: inconclusive\n- observed_hypothesis: Specific opposing lineups, defenders, play types and preceding opponent play types suppress star efficiency.\n- observed_result: Q5c verdict 'rank-1 suppressor varies meaningfully across players'; e.g. Jokic after opp POST_UP 1.1271 (-0.0675, SE +/-0.0500, n=480); Curry forced POST_UP -0.209.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)\n- observed_failure_evidence: Rank-1 deltas mostly within 1-2 SE with no multiple-comparison control; OTHER artifact flagged in doc.\n- observed_sample_and_power: SE per cell reported\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPA-050\n- observed_verdict: inconclusive\n- observed_failure_type: E_unclear\n- observed_notes: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_confidence: medium (0.65)"}], "n_results": 4}

